## 🚀 Deployment Instructions

### 📥 1. Apply the Configuration
Backup your current routing file and overwrite it with this production block [~ ➜]:
```bash
sudo cp torrc /etc/tor/torrc
```

### 🔍 2. Verify Syntax Integrity
Before firing up the engine, let the Tor binary parse the parameters to confirm its cryptographic layout is valid [~ ➜]:
```bash
tor --verify-config
```

### ⚙️ 3. Initialize the Service
```bash
sudo systemctl restart tor
```

